@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description
[*] --> Configuring : gf_frame_create
Configuring : owns a Runtime
Configuring : load / add_capability
Configuring : validate / initialize_restart
Configuring --> Configuring : failed activation\n(state preserved)
Configuring --> Active : gf_frame_activate\n(Runtime moved once)
Active : owns a ScanDriver
Active : gf_frame_scan
Active : load / add / activate rejected
Active --> Active : failed scan\n(last outcome and VM state kept)
Configuring --> [*] : gf_frame_destroy
Active --> [*] : gf_frame_destroy
@enduml
